   "old": "with $N_{\\rm px}$ pixels across a horizontal field of view HFOV,\n\n  $$f=\\frac{N_{\\rm px}/2}{\\tan(\\mathrm{HFOV}/2)} \\tag{151}$$",
   "new": "with $N_{\\rm col}$ pixel columns across a horizontal field of view $\\text{FOV}_{\\rm h}$ (the symbols of §A3, Eq. (1)),\n\n  $$f=\\frac{N_{\\rm col}/2}{\\tan(\\text{FOV}_{\\rm h}/2)} \\tag{151}$$",
