   "new": "A 0.05° step, $\\delta\\theta=0.873\\times10^{-3}$ rad, spans $R\\,\\delta\\theta=200\\times0.873\\times10^{-3}\\approx0.175$ m at 200 m, so a 0.5 m × 1.7 m pedestrian (the size used in §A3, §A5 and §C10.6(a)) covers",
