   "new": "Elevation-capable \"4D\" radars were about 40% of 2024 shipments. Under Yole's broad definition of 4D (above) that is about 66 M units ($0.40\\times166\\ {\\rm M}\\approx66$ M) [E]. The 2.74 M Chinese 4D installations for 2024 below cannot be compared with it: they cover one country's passenger cars, count installations rather than shipments and may use a narrower definition of 4D [E].",
