   "new": "camera Far3D 31.6 mAP vs lidar LION 41.5 (reported as 0.316 and 0.415 on a 0–1 scale) [I]; camera translation error is 1.5–1.7× worse. Argoverse 2 is a public dataset whose detection benchmark scores objects out to 150 m, three times the nuScenes limit.\n\n**End-to-end planning (NAVSIM):** camera-only 83.8 vs camera+lidar 84.0 PDMS [I].",
